          "note": "Topic 5.13.1, printed page 112, as printed: the seven properties as an ordered list under the printed heading Liquid crystals."
        }
      ],
      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "The general properties of liquid crystals are as follows:"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "Liquid crystals"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": true,
            "items": [
              "have parallel ordered arrangement.",
              "are elongated, rod-like and linear.",
              "flow like liquids",
              "show viscosity like liquids.",
              "show optical properties like crystals.",
              "are somewhat rigid.",
              "are always anisotropic."
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
